error[E0518]: accessors require a field, but 'Unit' names a type
 --> $DIR/type-alias.nra:4:9
  |
3 |     export let Unit = int;
  |                ---- 'Unit' is an alias of a type
4 |         | get: Unit;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^ accessor clause on a type alias
  |
  = help: remove the clause; only an exported instance field can have 'get' and 'set' accessors

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0518`.
